{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CUSTOM SUBCOLLECTIONS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Custom addition (not part of Impact core). Renders a row of chip links towards related collections at the top of a
collection page, driven by the vcollect.sous_collections collection metafield (list of collection references) so the
internal linking can be curated from the admin without touching the theme.

SEO purpose: the theme's facet form only exposes filters as checkboxes inside a GET form, which crawlers never follow
and whose filtered URLs canonicalize back to the base collection. These plain <a> links are the crawlable path between
sibling and parent collections (e.g. Displays -> Display Japonais), so keep them as regular anchors.

The label is hardcoded in French like the other custom snippets: the storefront sells in French only.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* collection: the collection whose metafield is read (required)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign sub_collections = collection.metafields.vcollect.sous_collections.value -%}

{%- if sub_collections != blank -%}
  <nav class="custom-subcollections" aria-label="Catégories associées">
    {%- for linked_collection in sub_collections -%}
      <a class="custom-subcollections__chip" href="{{ linked_collection.url }}">{{ linked_collection.title | escape }}</a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </nav>
{%- endif -%}
